Listed Modern Treatments have no capping. This treatment is not mentioned.
Sum Insured will be utilized as per the following sequence in event of any claim:
 a. Base Sum Insured followed by;
 b. Super Credit (if inbuilt / opted and applicable) followed by;
 c. Super Reload followed by;
 d. Cancer Booster (if opted and applicable)

Super credit utilization in Modern Treatments is not specified.
